# husky
# Only the generated shim directory. Husky v9 writes .husky/_ on install and
# ships its own .gitignore covering it, but naming it here keeps that explicit.
# Do NOT ignore .husky wholesale: hooks must stay committable, or `git add .`
# silently drops a new hook and it never runs for anyone else.
.husky/_

